<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2022-10 on</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2022-10/</link><description>Recent content in 2022-10 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 24 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2022-10/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>깨알행복</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog06/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog06/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="깨알행복"&gt;&#10; 깨알행복&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ea%b9%a8%ec%95%8c%ed%96%89%eb%b3%b5"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 10. 24. 11:51&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ebf973c-5c0f-4d26-90c2-fa55376abdc8" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;나 여기카페 그래도몇번왔는데 처음으로 주차했냐고 물어봄&amp;hellip; 나이제좀 어른같은걸까 이러니까 옷쇼핑을 멈출수가없지 ㅜ 휴&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="828" height="1792" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7661d044-29c0-4185-ba82-c10d85750445" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;헐 나이거 됐다 ㅋㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;오빠랑 커플티하라는 신의계시인가!! ㅋㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>끄덕끄덕일기</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog22/</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog22/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="끄덕끄덕일기"&gt;&#10; 끄덕끄덕일기&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%81%84%eb%8d%95%eb%81%84%eb%8d%95%ec%9d%bc%ea%b8%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 10. 10. 00:21&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="2275" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6ce21c9-ac4c-4d23-a362-b7555e8a498f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이수업은 좋으면서 싫고 먼가 애매..! 들으러가는길은 자유롭고 좋은데 들을때는 너무 고통스럽고 눈앞이흐려짐 근데 마치고 집가는길에는 날아갈것같다&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이날 박태준 카페탐험기 봤는데 진짜재밌었어서 더좋았다&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e27049ec-7d1b-42f0-9bc5-aef3547c08a3" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이날 되게알차게 뭔가를했는데 뭘했는지는 기억안나네&#10;스벅에서 빵시켜먹으면 기분 좋음&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/425f64cc-b635-48ae-8c1e-2acaf4a93fe6" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이날 엄마랑 민이랑 시내가서 마제소바 먹고 자라에 쇼핑도 갔다&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7bf9335f-a287-41d3-add4-e5b7cad7a8bb" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이날은 할머니 할아버지랑 브런치먹으러갔다&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1840" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9cfd694f-7340-41a3-87e4-3a07adea7b33" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;스켑틱을 집중잘될때에 읽으면 너무너무 행복함&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2aa1dda3-3f22-4434-9fbf-a83b7f5bbbaa" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;기분애매할때는 편의점에서 라면이나 과자 털이&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/047f2432-a8e3-468e-81c5-6fb8e09cb7f0" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이날 기분 안좋을필요 없었던데&amp;hellip; 아쉽다 안좋았던거&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>